{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Tower Defense game, inspired by classics like Bloons and Kingdom Rush, we introduce a new twist \u2013 the ability to move your towers around the map using a van called the &quot;Gear Machine.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/gif_drift_2.gif?t=1750385905\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The idea is simple: defend your base against an invasion of over 12 different types of robots. This will require some heavy firepower, as these robots are built with advanced materials. To fight back, humanity has developed a series of towers designed to take on this challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/gif_robots_2_.gif?t=1750385905\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And that\u2019s where your mission begins! Choose from over 10 different types of towers to find the best way to destroy all the robots. But it won\u2019t be easy \u2013 you'll have limited resources to buy towers, move them, and unlock new areas to place them. Each map also brings its own unique challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/gif_towers_2_.gif?t=1750385905\" /></div><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450120?t=1750385905","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450120?t=1750385905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/390af1d5e88db6ae24104deb3ce294c91b158470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750385905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/390af1d5e88db6ae24104deb3ce294c91b158470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750385905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Add to  wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Tower Defense game, inspired by classics like Bloons and Kingdom Rush, we introduce a new twist \u2013 the ability to move your towers around the map using a van called the &quot;Gear Machine.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/gif_drift_2.gif?t=1750385905\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The idea is simple: defend your base against an invasion of over 12 different types of robots. This will require some heavy firepower, as these robots are built with advanced materials. To fight back, humanity has developed a series of towers designed to take on this challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/gif_robots_2_.gif?t=1750385905\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And that\u2019s where your mission begins! Choose from over 10 different types of towers to find the best way to destroy all the robots. But it won\u2019t be easy \u2013 you'll have limited resources to buy towers, move them, and unlock new areas to place them. Each map also brings its own unique challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/gif_towers_2_.gif?t=1750385905\" /></div><br></p>","developers":["Broken Tooth Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/header.jpg?t=1750385905","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257089687,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089687/movie480.mp4?t=1745798854","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089687/movie_max.mp4?t=1745798854"},"name":"Teaser: Gears Of Glory","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257089687/f0678a97c5ace3fe2d57898ef5a59fc3ff79ef49/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745798854","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089687/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745798854","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089687/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745798854"}}],"name":"Gears of Glory","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Broken Tooth Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q4 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/b96f97113cda7bca3e33c7d0fea13255a